{"title": "Eyes of the Dark (Condition)", "pageid": 49705, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Eyes_of_the_Dark_(Condition)", "categories": ["Conditions"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div role=\"note\" class=\"hatnote noexcerpt\">This article is about the condition. For the passive feature, see <a href=\"/wiki/Eyes_of_the_Dark\" title=\"Eyes of the Dark\">Eyes of the Dark</a>. For the spell, see <a href=\"/wiki/Eyes_of_the_Dark:_Darkness\" title=\"Eyes of the Dark: Darkness\">Eyes of the Dark: Darkness</a>.  </div>  \n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\"> \n<div class=\"noexcerpt navigation-not-searchable\">\n<p><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/a/a4/Generic_Darkness_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Generic_Darkness_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/a/a4/Generic_Darkness_Condition_Icon.webp/45px-Generic_Darkness_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/a/a4/Generic_Darkness_Condition_Icon.webp/60px-Generic_Darkness_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Generic Darkness Condition Icon.webp\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/a/a4/Generic_Darkness_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Generic_Darkness_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/a/a4/Generic_Darkness_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> <b>Eyes of the Dark</b>\n</p>\n</div>\n<ul><li>You can see normally in darkness, both magical and non-magical, to a distance of 25 m (83 ft). </li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Properties\">Properties</span></h2>\n<div class=\"noexcerpt navigation-not-searchable\">\n<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Stack_ID\" title=\"Stack ID\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b2/Info_Icon.png/25px-Info_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/b/b2/Info_Icon.png 1.5x\"><img alt=\"Stack ID\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b2/Info_Icon.png/25px-Info_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/b/b2/Info_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Stack_ID\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Stack ID\">Stack ID</a>: <code class=\"bg3wiki-uid-box\">EYESOFTHEDARK_DARKNESS</code> <span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=%22data%2CStackId%2CEYESOFTHEDARK_DARKNESS%22+type:status\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=%22data%2CStackId%2CEYESOFTHEDARK_DARKNESS%22+type:status\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></div>\n</div> \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Notes\">Notes</span></h2>\n<ul><li>This condition works similar to the <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Devil%27s_Sight\" title=\"Devil's Sight\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c0/Devils_Sight_Icon.webp/25px-Devils_Sight_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/c/c0/Devils_Sight_Icon.webp/38px-Devils_Sight_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/c/c0/Devils_Sight_Icon.webp/50px-Devils_Sight_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Devil's Sight\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c0/Devils_Sight_Icon.webp/25px-Devils_Sight_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/c/c0/Devils_Sight_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Devil%27s_Sight\" title=\"Devil's Sight\">Devil's Sight</a> Eldritch Invocation, and thus the affected party member can see in magical darkness as well as regular darkness.</li>\n<li>This unique condition can be gained <i>only</i> when casting <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Eyes_of_the_Dark:_Darkness\" title=\"Eyes of the Dark: Darkness\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/a/aa/Eyes_of_the_Dark_Darkness_Icon.webp/25px-Eyes_of_the_Dark_Darkness_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/a/aa/Eyes_of_the_Dark_Darkness_Icon.webp/38px-Eyes_of_the_Dark_Darkness_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/a/aa/Eyes_of_the_Dark_Darkness_Icon.webp/50px-Eyes_of_the_Dark_Darkness_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Eyes of the Dark: Darkness\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/a/aa/Eyes_of_the_Dark_Darkness_Icon.webp/25px-Eyes_of_the_Dark_Darkness_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/a/aa/Eyes_of_the_Dark_Darkness_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Eyes_of_the_Dark:_Darkness\" title=\"Eyes of the Dark: Darkness\">Eyes of the Dark: Darkness</a> using 2 Sorcery Points. <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Darkness\" title=\"Darkness\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/b/bf/Darkness_Icon.webp/25px-Darkness_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/b/bf/Darkness_Icon.webp/38px-Darkness_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/b/bf/Darkness_Icon.webp/50px-Darkness_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Darkness\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/b/bf/Darkness_Icon.webp/25px-Darkness_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/b/bf/Darkness_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Darkness\" title=\"Darkness\">Darkness</a> cast by other party members, or by the Sorcerer using a 2nd Level spell slot still causes the affected party member to be <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Blinded_(Condition)\" title=\"Blinded (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/7/70/Blinded_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Blinded_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/7/70/Blinded_Condition_Icon.webp/38px-Blinded_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/7/70/Blinded_Condition_Icon.webp/50px-Blinded_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Blinded\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/7/70/Blinded_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Blinded_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/7/70/Blinded_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Blinded_(Condition)\" title=\"Blinded (Condition)\">Blinded</a>.</li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Sources_of_Eyes_of_the_Dark\">Sources of Eyes of the Dark</span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-condition-sources\"><ul>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 5px\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\" style=\"\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Eyes_of_the_Dark:_Darkness\" title=\"Eyes of the Dark: Darkness\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/a/aa/Eyes_of_the_Dark_Darkness_Icon.webp/30px-Eyes_of_the_Dark_Darkness_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/a/aa/Eyes_of_the_Dark_Darkness_Icon.webp/45px-Eyes_of_the_Dark_Darkness_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/a/aa/Eyes_of_the_Dark_Darkness_Icon.webp/60px-Eyes_of_the_Dark_Darkness_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Eyes of the Dark: Darkness\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/a/aa/Eyes_of_the_Dark_Darkness_Icon.webp/30px-Eyes_of_the_Dark_Darkness_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/a/aa/Eyes_of_the_Dark_Darkness_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" ti